      "workedSolutionSteps": [
        "Write options A–F as powers of x with exponents −5/2, −11/4, −3, −7/4, −2 and 1/2 respectively.",
        "For 0<x<1, a smaller exponent gives a greater value.",
        "The smallest exponent is −3, so option C, $(x^{-2})^{3/2}$, is greatest."
      ]
    },
    {
