      "repair": "Explanation revised, key unchanged",
      "workedSolutionSteps": [
        "Let A and B be positive powers of 2. Their product is 16384 and their sum is 320.",
        "Both are smaller than 320. The larger must be at least 160, so the only possible power of 2 in [160,320) is 256.",
        "The smaller is 320−256=64, and 256×64=16384. Their positive difference is 192."
      ]
    },
